TI Machine Learning Applications of Two-Phase Flow Data in Polymer Electrolyte Fuel Cell Reactant Channels
SO JOURNAL OF THE ELECTROCHEMICAL SOCIETY
LA English
DT Article; Proceedings Paper
CT PRiME Joint International Meeting of 238th Meeting of the Electrochemical-Society (ECS) / Fall Meeting of the Electrochemical-Society-of-Japan (ECSJ) / Fall Meeting of the Korean-Electrochemical-Society (KECS)
